# CORTEX VIDEO: the pages, a look, the scenes (SEL + key stores, a key recalls), the tempo, saving, a reboot keeps it
wait 500
expect page 0
tap OCT+
expect page 1
turn SELECT 2
expect page 3
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
expect page 0
spin K1 2
expect par0 7
press SEL
key 3 down
key 3 up
release SEL
expect scenes 8
spin K1 -4
expect par0 3
key 3 down
key 3 up
expect par0 7
expect scene 3
tap FX
wait 418
tap FX
wait 418
tap FX
expect bpm 120
spin PRESET 1
expect look 1
expect par0 4
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 500
expect par0 4
expect scenes 8
shot panel.png
